{
  "_comment": [
    "Referee view shape and statistics measured on production BEFORE the",
    "20260908000014 view-security repair, so that applying it can be shown to",
    "change privileges and nothing else.",
    "",
    "The repair only sets a storage option and revokes grants. Every number here",
    "is derived from the base tables, so none of it can move as a result. If any",
    "of it does move after the migration is applied, the migration did something",
    "it was not supposed to and scripts/referees/verify-view-security.mjs will",
    "say which field.",
    "",
    "The archive itself does change over time - new events are ingested - so a",
    "drift in the counts is not automatically a fault. viewdef_md5 and the column",
    "signatures are the fields that must NEVER change; the counts are compared",
    "with their source date attached so a reader can tell a real regression from",
    "a week of new fights."
  ],
